---
// The outbound marker for every external link. A stroked glyph rather than the
// "↗" character: that character's weight and baseline come from whatever font
// happens to resolve it, so it sat heavy and slightly low beside the label.
// This inherits colour and weight, and scales with the parent's font size.
//
// Styles live in global.css, not here: the hover rule keys off the enclosing
// <a>, which belongs to the parent component, and Astro's scoped styles cannot
// reach across that boundary.
---
<svg
  viewBox="0 0 12 12"
  fill="none"
  stroke="currentColor"
  stroke-width="1.4"
  stroke-linecap="round"
  stroke-linejoin="round"
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="ext-arrow"
>
  <path d="M3.6 8.4 8.4 3.6" />
  <path d="M4.9 3.6H8.4V7.1" />
</svg>
